#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/15
msgid ""
"She soon proved herself right.\n"
msgstr ""
"很快她就证明了自己。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/16
msgid ""
"The Boss was more than just a guinea pig.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Boss不只是试验品。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/17
msgid ""
"She drew on her experience to give the staff\n"
"focused advice exactly where it was needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"她凭经验在最关键的地方\n"
"给出中肯的建议。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/18
msgid ""
"NASA's space program took off again.\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA的太空计划重新起飞。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/19
msgid ""
"At the rate they were going, putting a man in\n"
"space seemed within reach...\n"
msgstr ""
"照这个进度，\n"
"载人航天似乎指日可待……\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/20
msgid ""
"The higher-ups at NASA were impressed with her\n"
"talents.\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA的高层\n"
"对她的才能印象深刻。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/21
msgid ""
"They took to calling her the eighth astronaut, the\n"
"\"Mercury Lady.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"他们开始叫她第八位宇航员，\n"
"「水星女士」。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/22
msgid ""
"The photo I sent you was taken around that time.\n"
msgstr ""
"我寄给你的照片就是那时拍的。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/23
msgid ""
"I suppose maybe they were planning to use it as\n"
"propaganda\n"
msgstr ""
"我想他们大概是打算\n"
"拿它做宣传\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/24
msgid ""
"- \"the world's first female astronaut.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"——「世界首位女宇航员」。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/25
msgid ""
"But then, just as things were looking up, they hit a\n"
"new snag.\n"
msgstr ""
"可就在形势好转时，\n"
"又出了新的麻烦。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/26
msgid ""
"The government told them to add a window.\n"
msgstr ""
"政府要求加装舷窗。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/27
msgid ""
"There were no windows in NASA spacecraft back\n"
"then.\n"
msgstr ""
"当时NASA的飞船\n"
"并没有舷窗。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/28
msgid ""
"Ham never saw the stars around him.\n"
msgstr ""
"汉姆就没看到过周围的星星。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/29
msgid ""
"But Washington insisted. Their sources told them\n"
"Soviet spaceships had windows.\n"
msgstr ""
"但华盛顿坚持。\n"
"情报称苏联飞船有舷窗。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/30
msgid ""
"Space exploration is a form of propaganda in itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"太空探索本身就是一种宣传。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/31
msgid ""
"After all, what was the point of sending a man into\n"
"space\n"
msgstr ""
"毕竟，把人\n"
"送上太空\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/32
msgid ""
"if he couldn't tell the world what he'd seen?\n"
msgstr ""
"却无法告诉世人他看到了什么？\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/33
msgid ""
"Most of all, though, they simply couldn't have the\n"
"Russians doing something they couldn't.\n"
msgstr ""
"最重要的是，他们不能容忍\n"
"俄国人做到了自己做不到的事。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/34
msgid ""
"It was sheer madness, and everybody knew it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这完全疯狂，人人都知道。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/35
msgid ""
"NASA was already facing impossible deadlines.\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA本就面临不可能的期限。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/36
msgid ""
"Now they were adding yet another element of\n"
"uncertainty to the mix.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在又添了\n"
"一个不确定因素。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/37
msgid ""
"Installing a window would both weaken the\n"
"spacecraft\n"
msgstr ""
"装舷窗既会\n"
"削弱飞船结构，\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/38
msgid ""
"and make it harder to shield the occupant from\n"
"cosmic rays.\n"
msgstr ""
"也会让乘员更难\n"
"免受宇宙射线伤害。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/39
msgid ""
"They weren't about to put their Mercury Seven\n"
"golden boys in that kind of danger.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们可不愿让水星七杰\n"
"这些金童身处那种险境。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/40
msgid ""
"So The Boss was chosen as the pilot instead...\n"
msgstr ""
"于是The Boss被选为了驾驶员……\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/41
msgid ""
"Even if she made it up into space,\n"
msgstr ""
"就算她能飞上太空，\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/42
#, c-format
msgid ""
"she was given less than a 20% chance of\n"
"returning to Earth alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"活着返回地球的几率\n"
"也不到两成。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/43
msgid ""
"But she took it in stride,\n"
msgstr ""
"可她坦然接受，\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/44
msgid ""
"even helping them make the necessary design\n"
"changes to the Mercury capsule.\n"
msgstr ""
"还帮着对水星返回舱\n"
"做了必要的设计改动。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/45
msgid ""
"It was like going to work every day at NASA to\n"
"make her own coffin.\n"
msgstr ""
"就像每天去NASA上班，\n"
"亲手打造自己的棺材。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/46
msgid ""
"Then, without warning, the U.S. received intelligence\n"
msgstr ""
"接着，美国毫无预警地收到情报：\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/47
msgid ""
"that the Soviets had moved their Vostok\n"
"spacecraft to the launch site.\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联已把东方号飞船\n"
"运到了发射场。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/0
msgid ""
"America couldn't let the Soviets beat them with\n"
"Vostok.\n"
msgstr ""
"美国不能让苏联人用东方号\n"
"抢先。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/1
msgid ""
"NASA was forced to cut short the testing process\n"
"and move the launch date up.\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA被迫缩短测试流程\n"
"提前发射日期。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/2
msgid ""
"They pulled out all the stops to get it scheduled\n"
"for the earliest hours of the next day.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们不惜一切代价，把发射\n"
"定在次日凌晨。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/3
msgid ""
"The spacecraft would be launched from Cape\n"
"Canaveral in the dead of night.\n"
msgstr ""
"飞船将在深夜从卡纳维拉尔角\n"
"发射升空。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/4
msgid ""
"For the flight path, they chose a course that would\n"
"take her as far east as possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们选了一条尽量向东的\n"
"飞行路线。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/5
msgid ""
"She'd be able to see the Earth in daylight from the\n"
"window, at least for a little while.\n"
msgstr ""
"她至少能透过舷窗短暂地\n"
"看到白昼中的地球。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/6
msgid ""
"The Boss climbed into the Mercury capsule\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS爬进水星号太空舱\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/7
#, c-format
msgid ""
"having completed less than 80% of the regular\n"
"flight procedures.\n"
msgstr ""
"此时常规飞行程序\n"
"完成不到80%。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/8
msgid ""
"Both the timing and the flight path were risky, and\n"
"testing was far from complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"时机和航线都很冒险，\n"
"测试远未完成。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/9
msgid ""
"But NASA had no other choice.\n"
msgstr ""
"但NASA别无选择。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/10
msgid ""
"The Boss, for her part, never expected to come\n"
"home alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"而THE BOSS自己，从没想过\n"
"能活着回来。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/11
msgid ""
"She was going on a one-way trip. The American\n"
"version of Laika the dog.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是一趟单程旅行。美国的\n"
"莱卡狗。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/12
msgid ""
"And yet she went all the same.\n"
msgstr ""
"可她还是去了。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/13
msgid ""
"\"Someone has to be first,\" she said. \"If fate has\n"
"chosen me, then I accept.\n"
msgstr ""
"“总得有人先来，”她说。“命运\n"
"选了我，我就接受。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/14
msgid ""
"For my country. For the balance of the world.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"为我的国家。为世界平衡。”\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/15
msgid ""
"That's how she saw things.\n"
msgstr ""
"她就是这么想的。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/16
msgid ""
"\"My chances may be slim, but I'll take them. I've\n"
"accepted my fate.\n"
msgstr ""
"“机会也许渺茫，但我要抓住。我已\n"
"接受命运。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/17
msgid ""
"If anyone can get through this, I can.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"如果有人能挺过去，那就是我。”\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/18
msgid ""
"Then, on April 12, at one thirty in the morning, The\n"
"Boss entered space.\n"
msgstr ""
"4月12日凌晨一点半，THE\n"
"BOSS进入了太空。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/19
msgid ""
"It was nothing short of a miracle.\n"
msgstr ""
"这简直是奇迹。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/20
msgid ""
"First, that she'd made it in an incomplete\n"
"spacecraft.\n"
msgstr ""
"第一，她乘着未完成的\n"
"飞船成功了。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/21
msgid ""
"And second, that her flight coincided almost\n"
"exactly with Gagarin's.\n"
msgstr ""
"第二，她的飞行几乎与\n"
"加加林完全重合。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/22
msgid ""
"As the sun rose over the horizon\n"
msgstr ""
"当太阳从地平线升起\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/23
msgid ""
"- and cosmic rays began to bombard her through\n"
"the window - she saw the Earth.\n"
msgstr ""
"- 宇宙射线开始穿过窗户轰击她 -\n"
"她看到了地球。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/24
msgid ""
"I think you've heard the story before.\n"
msgstr ""
"这故事你大概听过。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/25
msgid ""
"It was a world without borders. A perfect jewel.\n"
msgstr ""
"那是无国界的世界。完美宝石。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/26
msgid ""
"All nations, all ideologies - they seemed so far away.\n"
msgstr ""
"所有国家、意识形态，都那么遥远。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/27
msgid ""
"It almost made her laugh, knowing that they'd\n"
"risked so much\n"
msgstr ""
"想到他们冒了这么大风险，\n"
"她几乎笑了出来\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/28
msgid ""
"to beat the Soviets by a few short minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"只为比苏联人快几分钟。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/29
msgid ""
"If she'd seen Vostok from her window, she\n"
"probably would have waved.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果她从窗户看到了东方号，\n"
"她大概会挥挥手。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/30
msgid ""
"But the two spacecraft were destined for very\n"
"different fates.\n"
msgstr ""
"但这两艘飞船注定要面对\n"
"截然不同的命运。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/31
msgid ""
"Gagarin circled the Earth and returned to the\n"
"Soviet Union safe and sound.\n"
msgstr ""
"加加林绕地球飞行后，\n"
"安然无恙地返回了苏联。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/32
msgid ""
"The Mercury capsule, on the other hand, deviated\n"
"from its planned reentry angle.\n"
msgstr ""
"而水星号太空舱，则偏离了\n"
"计划中的再入角度。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/33
msgid ""
"The addition of a window had thrown the capsule's\n"
"aerodynamics off balance.\n"
msgstr ""
"加装窗户破坏了太空舱的\n"
"空气动力学平衡。\n"

#: codec/1/283/0x11b5a0/34
msgid ""
"The Boss's 'coffin' veered wildly off course, and\n"
"began to plunge earthward...\n"
msgstr ""
"老板的“棺材”剧烈偏离航线，\n"
"开始向地面坠落……\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/0
msgid ""
"The course deviation caused the capsule to miss\n"
"its splashdown point by a wide margin.\n"
msgstr ""
"航线偏差使返回舱\n"
"远远偏离了预定落点。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/1
msgid ""
"It didn't have enough time to decelerate before\n"
"crashing into the sea.\n"
msgstr ""
"它来不及减速\n"
"就坠入了大海。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/2
msgid ""
"The force of the impact shattered the spacecraft,\n"
"before it started to sink like a stone.\n"
msgstr ""
"撞击的冲击让飞船四分五裂，\n"
"随后像石头一样沉入海底。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/3
msgid ""
"The Boss used the last of her strength to escape\n"
"to the surface...\n"
msgstr ""
"The Boss用尽最后的力气\n"
"逃到了海面……\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/4
msgid ""
"Her body was covered in bruises and scorched by\n"
"radiation.\n"
msgstr ""
"她遍体瘀伤，\n"
"被辐射灼烧。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/6
msgid ""
"She slipped into a coma and didn't regain\n"
"consciousness for six months.\n"
msgstr ""
"她陷入昏迷，\n"
"半年后才恢复意识。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/7
msgid ""
"To some, what was worst of all was that\n"
msgstr ""
"对有些人来说，最糟的是\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/8
msgid ""
"she had lost the space race to Gagarin by only a\n"
"few minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"她只差几分钟，\n"
"就把太空竞赛输给了加加林。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/9
msgid ""
"That aside, it should have been a proud day for\n"
"America\n"
msgstr ""
"抛开这点，\n"
"那本该是美国骄傲的一天\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/10
msgid ""
"- its first manned spaceflight.\n"
msgstr ""
"——它的首次载人航天。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/11
msgid ""
"Sadly, her accomplishment was kept out of the\n"
"history books.\n"
msgstr ""
"遗憾的是，她的成就\n"
"被排除在史册之外。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/12
msgid ""
"An attempt to save face by Washington.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是华盛顿挽回面子的做法。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/13
msgid ""
"In contrast to Gagarin's orbital fight, America had\n"
"only managed a ballistic trajectory.\n"
msgstr ""
"与加加林的轨道飞行相比，\n"
"美国只完成了弹道飞行。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/14
msgid ""
"Her flight time was much shorter, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"她的飞行时间也短得多。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/15
msgid ""
"And most importantly, the Soviets had brought\n"
"back both spacecraft and pilot safely.\n"
msgstr ""
"最重要的是，苏联把飞船和飞行员\n"
"都安全带了回来。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/16
msgid ""
"NASA couldn't even conjure up a half-hearted tale\n"
"of heroic survival.\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA连个像样的\n"
"英雄生还故事都编不出来。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/17
msgid ""
"The coup de grace, though, was\n"
msgstr ""
"而致命一击是\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/18
msgid ""
"the Soviet propaganda campaign that kicked into\n"
"gear after the flight.\n"
msgstr ""
"飞行之后启动的\n"
"苏联宣传机器。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/19
msgid ""
"\"The Earth was blue...\" Those were the words of\n"
"Gagarin on his return.\n"
msgstr ""
"「地球是蓝色的……」\n"
"这是加加林归来时说的话。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/20
msgid ""
"And the whole world was listening.\n"
msgstr ""
"全世界都在倾听。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/21
msgid ""
"In the blink of an eye, Gagarin was an international\n"
"celebrity, earning accolades from every corner.\n"
msgstr ""
"转瞬之间，加加林成了国际名人，\n"
"荣誉来自四面八方。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/22
msgid ""
"It was a PR coup for the Soviet Union.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是苏联宣传战的一次大捷。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/23
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, Washington could only grit its teeth in\n"
"silence.\n"
msgstr ""
"而华盛顿只能\n"
"咬牙沉默。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/24
msgid ""
"They decided there was no value in making The\n"
"Boss' flight public,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们认定公开The Boss的飞行\n"
"毫无价值，\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/25
msgid ""
"that it would only make matters worse.\n"
msgstr ""
"只会让事情更糟。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/26
msgid ""
"So they buried it instead, labeling it a dark mission...\n"
msgstr ""
"于是他们把它埋葬，定性为黑色任务……\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/27
msgid ""
"NASA and the CIA did everything in their power\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA和中情局用尽一切手段\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/28
msgid ""
"to erase all traces of The Boss from Project\n"
"Mercury.\n"
msgstr ""
"把The Boss的痕迹\n"
"从水星计划中抹去。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/29
msgid ""
"The result was the photo you see before you. Not\n"
"a bad job, huh?\n"
msgstr ""
"结果就是你眼前这张照片。\n"
"干得不错吧？\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/30
msgid ""
"Not only did they expunge her flight from the\n"
"records,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们不但把她的飞行\n"
"从记录中抹除，\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/31
msgid ""
"they denied that she ever existed.\n"
msgstr ""
"还否认她曾经存在。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/32
msgid ""
"And that wasn't the end of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"事情还没完。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/33
msgid ""
"As an alibi, the military claimed\n"
msgstr ""
"为了制造不在场证明，军方宣称\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/34
msgid ""
"she'd taken part in the CIA's botched Bay of Pigs\n"
"plot to take back Cuba.\n"
msgstr ""
"她参与了中情局\n"
"搞砸的猪湾夺回古巴行动。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/35
msgid ""
"And when The Boss was finally well enough to\n"
"return to service,\n"
msgstr ""
"等The Boss终于康复\n"
"可以归队时，\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/36
msgid ""
"they wouldn't take her back. She was forced to go\n"
"underground.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们却不肯接收她。\n"
"她被迫转入地下。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/37
msgid ""
"In the public eye, The Boss was still a hero of\n"
"World War II.\n"
msgstr ""
"在公众眼中，The Boss仍是\n"
"二战英雄。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/38
msgid ""
"In reality, though, she was anything but that.\n"
msgstr ""
"可现实里，她早已不是了。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/39
msgid ""
"She was a non-person, fit only for the blackest of\n"
"black ops...\n"
msgstr ""
"她成了不存在的人，\n"
"只配执行最黑暗的黑色行动……\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/40
msgid ""
"In effect, she may as well have been dead.\n"
msgstr ""
"实际上，她与死了无异。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/41
msgid ""
"Gagarin went on a worldwide tour in front of\n"
"millions of adoring fans.\n"
msgstr ""
"加加林环球巡游，\n"
"面对无数崇拜者。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/42
msgid ""
"The Boss, meanwhile, was a walking secret,\n"
msgstr ""
"而The Boss则是行走的秘密，\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/43
msgid ""
"unable to breath a word about her experience.\n"
msgstr ""
"对自己的经历只字不能提。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/44
msgid ""
"The authorities in Washington had this to say:\n"
msgstr ""
"华盛顿当局是这样说的：\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/45
msgid ""
"\"Why are you still here?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「你怎么还活着？」\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/46
msgid ""
"\"If only you'd had the decency to give us a nice\n"
"quote like Gagarin\n"
msgstr ""
"「你要是能像加加林那样，\n"
"给我们留一句漂亮话\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/47
msgid ""
"and then die an honorable death, you'd have gone\n"
"down as a hero.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"再光荣地死去，\n"
"你本会以英雄之名留名。」\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/48
msgid ""
"Three weeks later, on May 5th, Alan Shepard,\n"
msgstr ""
"三周后的5月5日，艾伦·谢泼德\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/49
msgid ""
"one of the Mercury Seven, made his own ballistic\n"
"flight.\n"
msgstr ""
"水星七杰之一\n"
"完成了自己的弹道飞行。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/50
msgid ""
"They sure didn't try to cover up his achievement.\n"
msgstr ""
"他的成就可没有被掩盖。\n"

#: codec/1/284/0x11c2d0/51
msgid ""
"Of course, he owed his success to the lessons\n"
"learned from The Boss' tragedy.\n"
msgstr ""
"当然，他的成功\n"
"得益于The Boss悲剧换来的教训。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/0
msgid ""
"And who should she find awaiting her return to\n"
"Russia?\n"
msgstr ""
"而她回到俄国时，\n"
"等在那里的是谁？\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/1
msgid ""
"The one who'd turned her sleeper against her,\n"
"who'd fed them lies all this time?\n"
msgstr ""
"那个策反了她潜伏特工的人，\n"
"一直用谎言蒙蔽他们的人？\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/2
msgid ""
"It was her former comrade-in-arms, the father of\n"
"her child.\n"
msgstr ""
"是她昔日的战友，\n"
"她孩子的父亲。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/3
msgid ""
"The man known as The Sorrow.\n"
msgstr ""
"那个被称为The Sorrow的男人。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/4
msgid ""
"He didn't know it was The Boss who'd sent the\n"
"sleeper.\n"
msgstr ""
"他不知道派来潜伏者的\n"
"就是The Boss。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/5
msgid ""
"Or to be more precise, the Soviet Philosophers\n"
"never told him.\n"
msgstr ""
"更准确地说，\n"
"苏联哲学家从没告诉过他。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/6
msgid ""
"Former lovers, forced to fight to the death.\n"
msgstr ""
"昔日的恋人，被迫生死相搏。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/7
msgid ""
"\"One would live, and one would die,\" she told me.\n"
msgstr ""
"「一个活，一个死，」她对我说。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/8
msgid ""
"\"That was the revenge the Soviet Philosophers had\n"
"in store for me.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「那就是苏联哲学家\n"
"为我准备的复仇。」\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/9
msgid ""
"If both of them survived, their child would suffer in\n"
"their place.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果两人都活下来，\n"
"他们的孩子就会代他们受苦。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/10
msgid ""
"They were left with no other option.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们别无选择。\n"

#: codec/1/285/0x11dc60/11
msgid ""
"The Boss shot him.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Boss开枪杀了他。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/0
msgid ""
"...It's me.\n"
msgstr ""
"……是我。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/1
msgid ""
"Smoothly, naturally.\n"
msgstr ""
"平稳、自然。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/2
msgid ""
"No, Big Boss doesn't know the truth...\n"
msgstr ""
"不，BIG BOSS不知道真相……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/3
msgid ""
"No, Langley hasn't decided what to do yet.\n"
msgstr ""
"不，兰利还没决定怎么办。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/4
msgid ""
"Their hands are full with their own mess.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们自己烂摊子都忙不过来。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/5
msgid ""
"True, Lubyanka is in the same boat...\n"
msgstr ""
"没错，卢比扬卡也一样……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/6
msgid ""
"Yes, other eyes continue to watch, but no sign of\n"
"contact so far.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的，其他眼睛仍在看，但至今无\n"
"接触迹象。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/7
msgid ""
"...Exactly. It's a non-state army to use however\n"
"they want.\n"
msgstr ""
"……没错。非国家军队，任由\n"
"他们使用。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/8
msgid ""
"They've probably decided there's no sense in\n"
"wiping them out just yet.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们大概认定，现在\n"
"将他们彻底消灭毫无意义。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/9
msgid ""
"Better to make... use of them.\n"
msgstr ""
"不如……利用他们。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/10
msgid ""
"Indeed they have... There's a site near Angola...\n"
msgstr ""
"确实……安哥拉附近有个据点……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/11
msgid ""
"And we've fully validated the AI as well...\n"
msgstr ""
"AI也已完全验证……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/12
msgid ""
"Agreed. In the end, a machine is just that: a\n"
"machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"同意。机器终究只是：\n"
"机器。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/13
msgid ""
"Sigint was right. It seems it's time for a change in\n"
"approach.\n"
msgstr ""
"SIGINT说得对。看来是时候改变\n"
"策略了。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/14
msgid ""
"Machines are best suited to specialize in high-level\n"
"data processing.\n"
msgstr ""
"机器最适合专门处理高级\n"
"数据。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/15
msgid ""
"Yes... Of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的……当然。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/16
msgid ""
"Speaking of which, any news on the \"sons\"...?\n"
msgstr ""
"说到这个，“儿子们”有消息吗……？\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/17
msgid ""
"Two already... Really...\n"
msgstr ""
"已经两个了……真的……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/18
msgid ""
"...But they're strictly an insurance policy, yes?\n"
msgstr ""
"……但他们只是保险措施，对吧？\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/19
msgid ""
"Mmmmm... So that's the idea...\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯……原来如此……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/20
msgid ""
"I wonder how Big Boss will respond...\n"
msgstr ""
"不知BIG BOSS会怎么回应……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/21
msgid ""
"Yes. But I'm only interested in the business angle.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的。但我只对生意感兴趣。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/22
msgid ""
"Like I said before, I'm neither an enemy nor an ally.\n"
msgstr ""
"我说过了，我既不是敌人也不是盟友。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/23
msgid ""
"I'm merely a business partner. Don't forget it.\n"
msgstr ""
"我只是生意伙伴。别忘了。\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/24
msgid ""
"Yes, I'll be in touch...\n"
msgstr ""
"好，我会联系你的……\n"

#: codec/1/287/0x11f180/25
msgid ""
"my dear Zero (CIPHER).\n"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的ZERO（Cipher）。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/0
msgid ""
"How's that map, Snake? Think you can\n"
"use it?\n"
msgstr ""
"地图怎样，Snake？你能\n"
"用上吗？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/1
msgid ""
"It tells me where their bases are, but it's\n"
"just a bunch of points.\n"
msgstr ""
"能看出他们的基地在哪，但只是\n"
"一堆点。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/2
msgid ""
"No routes. I need better intel on the lay\n"
"of the land.\n"
msgstr ""
"没有路线。我需要更详细的地形\n"
"情报。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/3
msgid ""
"Snake, the \"professor\" said he's got the\n"
"Sandinistas on his side.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，“教授”说他得到了\n"
"桑地诺派的支持。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/4
msgid ""
"Said you should get in touch with the\n"
"FSLN comandante.\n"
msgstr ""
"让你联系FSLN的\n"
"指挥官。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/5
msgid ""
"Do they know they're backed by KGB?\n"
msgstr ""
"他们知道背后是克格勃？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/6
msgid ""
"Nah... As far as they know they're really\n"
"fighting for the revolution.\n"
msgstr ""
"不知道……他们以为自己在\n"
"为革命而战。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/7
msgid ""
"The KGB is staying behind the scenes.\n"
msgstr ""
"克格勃躲在幕后。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/8
msgid ""
"I'm not sure the Sandinistas are aware of\n"
"what's really going on.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不确定桑地诺派是否清楚\n"
"真实情况。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/9
msgid ""
"Still can't believe anybody'd bring nukes\n"
"here...\n"
msgstr ""
"还是不信有人会把核弹\n"
"带这来……\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/10
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's a shocker.\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，太震惊。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/11
msgid ""
"Costa Rica's party to the Tlatelolco\n"
"Treaty,\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加是特拉特洛尔科\n"
"条约的缔约国，\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/12
msgid ""
"which declares Latin America a nuke-free\n"
"zone.\n"
msgstr ""
"宣布拉丁美洲为无核\n"
"区。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/13
msgid ""
"Based on Japan's Three Non-Nuclear\n"
"Principles,\n"
msgstr ""
"基于日本的无核三\n"
"原则，\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/14
msgid ""
"it bans the testing, use, import, or\n"
"deployment of nuclear weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"它禁止核武器的试验、使用、进口或\n"
"部署。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/15
msgid ""
"If word of this gets out, OPANAL will be\n"
"forced to act.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果消息泄露，OPANAL将\n"
"被迫采取行动。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/16
msgid ""
"It'll cause an international uproar.\n"
msgstr ""
"会引发国际轩然大波。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/17
msgid ""
"The Treaty was signed to prevent\n"
"another Cuban Missile Crisis.\n"
msgstr ""
"签这条约就为防\n"
"古巴导弹危机重演。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/18
msgid ""
"If the U.S. itself is going to scrap it...\n"
msgstr ""
"如果美国自己要撕毁它……\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/19
msgid ""
"Latin America's too close to spawning\n"
"another Cuba or two already.\n"
msgstr ""
"拉丁美洲已经太接近催生\n"
"又一个或两个古巴了。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/20
msgid ""
"The entire continent would become one\n"
"big powder keg.\n"
msgstr ""
"整个大陆将变成一个\n"
"巨大的火药桶。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/21
msgid ""
"Well... If they did bring nukes, we can't let\n"
"them get away with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"好吧……若他们真带了核武，不能放\n"
"他们走。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/22
msgid ""
"Are they planning a test? Showing off?\n"
msgstr ""
"他们打算试验？还是炫耀？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/23
msgid ""
"Or is it all to keep the anti-American\n"
"movement in check?\n"
msgstr ""
"还是说这一切都是为了遏制反美\n"
"运动？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/24
msgid ""
"Good question. Why bring them here? I\n"
"can't figure it out.\n"
msgstr ""
"好问题。为何带他们来这？我\n"
"想不通。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/25
msgid ""
"Whatever the CIA's up to in Costa Rica,\n"
"the \"professor\" wants it stopped.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管CIA在哥斯达黎加搞什么，\n"
"“教授”都要它停。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/26
msgid ""
"We need to find out what that something\n"
"is.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们需要查明那东西\n"
"是什么。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/27
msgid ""
"We need to get ready first, Kaz. Repairs?\n"
msgstr ""
"得先准备，卡兹。修理呢？\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/28
msgid ""
"Working as fast as we can, Boss. This\n"
"place is pretty beat... It looks like hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们尽快干，老大。这\n"
"地方真破……像地狱。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/29
msgid ""
"But as long as you're with us, we'll make\n"
"it heaven.\n"
msgstr ""
"但只要你和我们在一起，我们会让\n"
"它变成天堂。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/30
msgid ""
"No one can bother us here. No state\n"
"telling us what to do.\n"
msgstr ""
"这没人打扰我们。没国家\n"
"叫我们干啥。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/31
msgid ""
"This is the MSF's haven, our Mother Base.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是MSF的避风港，母基地。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/32
msgid ""
"And with this foothold, we'll back you up\n"
"even better than before.\n"
msgstr ""
"有了这个立足点，我们会比以前\n"
"更好地支持你。\n"

#: codec/2/901/0x385620/33
msgid ""
"We're gonna turn this pile of junk into\n"
"something big.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们要把这堆垃圾变成\n"
"了不起的东西。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I rigged that radio so you can\n"
"contact our young lady friend Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，我改了那台无线电，你能\n"
"联系咱年轻朋友Paz。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/1
msgid ""
"Is she OK?\n"
msgstr ""
"她还好吗？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/2
msgid ""
"No need to worry. She's tougher than you\n"
"think...\n"
msgstr ""
"别担心。她比你\n"
"想的更坚强……\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/3
msgid ""
"Still just a kid.\n"
msgstr ""
"还只是个孩子。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/4
msgid ""
"Which is exactly why she could be an\n"
"effective source of information.\n"
msgstr ""
"这正是为什么她能成为\n"
"有效的信息来源。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/5
msgid ""
"Besides, that little ángel de la paz is the\n"
"one who gave us this mission, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"再说，那个小天使\n"
"就是给我们这个任务的人，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/6
msgid ""
"...I guess.\n"
msgstr ""
"……大概吧。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/7
msgid ""
"I'll put her on.\n"
msgstr ""
"我让她接。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/9
msgid ""
"Paz. Where are you?\n"
msgstr ""
"帕兹。你在哪？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/10
msgid ""
"Ciudad Colón. A school. The teacher told\n"
"me to stay here until things quiet down.\n"
msgstr ""
"科隆城。一所学校。老师让我\n"
"待在这里直到局势平静下来。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/11
msgid ""
"Teacher? Oh, him. He's... Yeah, that's\n"
"probably good advice.\n"
msgstr ""
"老师？哦，他啊。他……是的，那\n"
"大概是个好建议。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/12
msgid ""
"Si. He has a radio in his room, so we can\n"
"talk anytime.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的。他房间里有一台收音机，所以我们\n"
"随时都能联系。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/13
msgid ""
"...Pretty fancy for a teacher.\n"
msgstr ""
"……老师挺阔气。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/14
msgid ""
"Promise me, Snake, that you'll bring back\n"
"peace. And...\n"
msgstr ""
"答应我，Snake，你会带回\n"
"和平。还有……\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/15
msgid ""
"I know. I'll contact you if I find your friend.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道。找到你朋友就联系你。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/16
msgid ""
"Thank you. Snake, if you need to know\n"
"about Costa Rica\n"
msgstr ""
"谢谢。Snake，若你想了解\n"
"哥斯达黎加\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/17
msgid ""
"- the geography, the climate, the wildlife,\n"
"anything - just ask me.\n"
msgstr ""
"地理、气候、野生动物，\n"
"啥都行，尽管问我。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/18
msgid ""
"I know about its history and laws, too. We\n"
"learned it all in school.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也了解它的历史和律法。我们\n"
"在学校都学过。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/19
msgid ""
"Got it. I have a question, I'll ask.\n"
msgstr ""
"明白。有问题我就问。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/20
msgid ""
"...I, uh...\n"
msgstr ""
"……我，呃……\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/22
msgid ""
"In school I also learned that peace is an\n"
"unnatural state for human society.\n"
msgstr ""
"学校还教我，和平对人类社会\n"
"是非自然状态。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/23
msgid ""
"And that war is a constant threat to our\n"
"relationships with others.\n"
msgstr ""
"而战争是对我们与他人关系的\n"
"持续威胁。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/25
msgid ""
"So, to achieve peace, we have to create\n"
"it ourselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以，和平得靠我们亲手\n"
"创造。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/26
msgid ""
"Crying about it won't bring it about, or\n"
"make it last.\n"
msgstr ""
"哭泣不会带来和平，也\n"
"不会让它持久。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/27
msgid ""
"Each one of us must go and seek it out.\n"
msgstr ""
"每个人都得自己去追寻。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/28
msgid ""
"You won't find it without making sacrifices.\n"
msgstr ""
"不付出牺牲就找不到。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/29
msgid ""
"No offense, but I don't know what peace\n"
"is.\n"
msgstr ""
"无意冒犯，但我不知道和平\n"
"是什么。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/30
msgid ""
"Never felt what it's like. Never even been\n"
"interested in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"从未感受过。甚至从未\n"
"对它感兴趣。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/31
msgid ""
"Snake...?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE……？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/32
msgid ""
"Ah, sorry.\n"
msgstr ""
"啊，抱歉。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/33
msgid ""
"Listen Paz, I think your ideas are...\n"
"admirable, and I hope they turn out to be\n"
"right.\n"
msgstr ""
"听着，帕兹，你的想法……\n"
"令人敬佩，我也希望\n"
"你是对的。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/34
msgid ""
"Yeah, me too.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯，我也是。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/35
msgid ""
"Peace is in your name. Who better to\n"
"help bring it back?\n"
msgstr ""
"和平在你名字里。谁更\n"
"适合找回它？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/36
msgid ""
"Thanks, Snake. I will be here whenever\n"
"you need me. See you later.\n"
msgstr ""
"谢谢，SNAKE。你需要我时\n"
"我随时都在。回头见。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/37
msgid ""
"Snake, use your radio to call people.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，用无线电联系人。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/38
msgid ""
"But stay alert.\n"
msgstr ""
"但保持警惕。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/39
msgid ""
"You're in the middle of a mission, and\n"
"can't afford to let your guard down.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在执行任务，\n"
"不能放松戒备。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/41
msgid ""
"Need to know more about Costa Rica?\n"
"Paz can help you out.\n"
msgstr ""
"想多了解哥斯达黎加？\n"
"帕兹能帮你。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/42
msgid ""
"Good to know.\n"
msgstr ""
"知道了。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/43
msgid ""
"We'll follow their transport route. That\n"
"should take us straight to their main base.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们跟着他们的运输路线走。\n"
"应该能直达他们的主基地。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/44
msgid ""
"From what I've seen, it looks like nukes.\n"
msgstr ""
"看情况，像是核弹。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/45
msgid ""
"Agreed.\n"
msgstr ""
"同意\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/46
msgid ""
"The key thing now is to confirm whether\n"
"those \"spears\" really are what we think\n"
"they are, and if so, why they're here.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在关键是确认那些“矛”\n"
"是否真如我们所想，\n"
"若是，又为何在此。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/47
msgid ""
"Follow the transport route, find the nukes.\n"
msgstr ""
"跟着运输路线，找到核弹。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/48
msgid ""
"That's what I'm thinking.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也这么想。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/49
msgid ""
"First, we should make contact with the\n"
"Sandinista comandante.\n"
msgstr ""
"首先，我们得联系上\n"
"桑地诺派的指挥官。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/50
msgid ""
"They can tell us more about what's up\n"
"ahead.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们能告诉我们\n"
"前方的情况。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/51
msgid ""
"But it looks like their hideout's already\n"
"come under attack.\n"
msgstr ""
"但他们的藏身处\n"
"似乎已遭攻击。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/52
msgid ""
"We'd better hope they're still alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"但愿他们还活着。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/53
msgid ""
"Snake, infiltrate that cabin and secure\n"
"the Sandinistas' comandante.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，潜入那间小屋，\n"
"保护桑地诺派指挥官。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/54
msgid ""
"Neutralize any guards by knocking them\n"
"out,\n"
msgstr ""
"击倒守卫，将其制服\n"
"击晕，\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/55
msgid ""
"putting them to sleep, or even using the\n"
"Fulton recovery system.\n"
msgstr ""
"让他们昏睡，或用\n"
"富尔顿回收系统。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/56
msgid ""
"You choose how to handle it, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么处理由你定，BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387380/0
msgid ""
"Snake, what was that thing?!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，那啥玩意？！\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 821..1532
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/1
msgid ""
"Whatever it was, it looked unmanned.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管是什么，看起来是无人操控的。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 1602..2716
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/2
msgid ""
"Unmanned? I'd heard rumors, but an\n"
"operational unit...?\n"
msgstr ""
"无人？我听过传言，但已经有\n"
"实战机型了……？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 2716..3274
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/3
msgid ""
"What the hell is going on here?\n"
msgstr ""
"这里到底发生了什么？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 3315..4820
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/4
msgid ""
"Not to quote Amanda, but the hardware\n"
"they've got here isn't just unusual, it's\n"
"overkill.\n"
msgstr ""
"不是学阿曼达，但他们这的\n"
"装备不只罕见，简直\n"
"火力过剩。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 4876..6227
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/5
msgid ""
"Which means one thing: it's nukes. So the\n"
"question now becomes, why?\n"
msgstr ""
"那就意味一件事：是核武。那\n"
"现在问题是，为啥？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 6227..7174
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/6
msgid ""
"We can't make that call yet. We need\n"
"more intel.\n"
msgstr ""
"还不能下结论。需要\n"
"更多情报。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 7244..7885
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/7
msgid ""
"How? Our source is dead.\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么弄？线人已经死了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 8052..8554
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/8
msgid ""
"But his daughter isn't.\n"
msgstr ""
"但他女儿没死。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 8609..9264
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/9
msgid ""
"Good thinking. We can follow her...\n"
msgstr ""
"好主意。可以跟着她……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 9362..10602
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/10
msgid ""
"Head for that the next outpost, and make\n"
"contact with Amanda... if she's still alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"前往下一个哨站，联系\n"
"阿曼达……如果她还活着。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 10616..10866
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/11
msgid ""
"Roger.\n"
msgstr ""
"收到。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387770/0
msgid ""
"The direction Amanda's Sandinistas were\n"
"going\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达的桑地诺军前进的\n"
"方向\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387770/1
msgid ""
"corresponds to the location of the next\n"
"outpost, a supply depot.\n"
msgstr ""
"正好对应下一个哨站的位置，\n"
"一个补给站。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387770/2
msgid ""
"We should be able to make contact with\n"
"her there.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们应该能在那里联系上\n"
"她。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x3878d0/0
msgid ""
"That's an armored vehicle unit, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"那是装甲车部队，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x3878d0/1
msgid ""
"Either destroy the vehicle or neutralize\n"
"the soldiers. Take it out!\n"
msgstr ""
"要么摧毁车辆，要么制伏\n"
"士兵。干掉它！\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Amanda's reached the plant.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，阿曼达到了工厂。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 1462..2117
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/2
msgid ""
"Amanda, how do you feel?\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达，你感觉怎么样？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 2229..3705
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/3
msgid ""
"Some first helicopter ride. I'll be perfectly\n"
"happy if it's my last.\n"
msgstr ""
"头一回坐直升机。要是最后一次\n"
"我可太高兴了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 3817..4444
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/4
msgid ""
"As you can see, she's doing fine.\n"
msgstr ""
"如你所见，她没事。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 4486..5879
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/5
msgid ""
"I set Amanda up with her own frequency,\n"
"so call her anytime you need to.\n"
msgstr ""
"我给阿曼达设了专属频率，\n"
"有需要随时呼她。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 5935..8317
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/6
msgid ""
"If you have any questions about American\n"
"bases or mercenary units, or about el\n"
"Frente, just ask.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是对美国的基地或雇佣兵部队，\n"
"或者对Frente有疑问，\n"
"尽管问。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 8373..9877
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/7
msgid ""
"And please, don't forget my compas and\n"
"Chico...\n"
msgstr ""
"还有，别忘了我的compas和\n"
"奇科……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 9919..10309
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/8
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\n"
msgstr ""
"别担心。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 10337..11131
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/9
msgid ""
"It’s good to be working with you, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"能和您并肩作战真好，Boss。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 11243..12190
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/10
msgid ""
"Snake, we can monitor her condition in\n"
"sick bay.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，可在医务室\n"
"监控她状况。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 12288..13472
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/11
msgid ""
"Remember to assign roles to any POWs\n"
"you bring back to Mother Base.\n"
msgstr ""
"记得给带回母基地的战俘\n"
"分配岗位。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 13569..14712
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/12
msgid ""
"How this outfit gets built depends on who\n"
"we assign to what jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"部队怎么建，看我们\n"
"把谁分到什么岗。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 14740..15436
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/13
msgid ""
"That'll determine how Mother Base grows.\n"
msgstr ""
"这决定了母基地的发展。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 15478..16161
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/14
msgid ""
"It's one of your most important roles,\n"
"Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是你最重要的职责之一，\n"
"BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387f00/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the nukes appear to have left the\n"
"coastal marshes\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，核弹似乎已经离开了\n"
"沿海沼泽\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387f00/1
msgid ""
"and reached the mountains around Irazú.\n"
msgstr ""
"抵达了伊拉苏山一带。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Chico made it over.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，奇科来了。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/2
msgid ""
"Chico, you made it.\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科，你成功了。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/3
msgid ""
"Made it?! Don't give me that!\n"
msgstr ""
"成功？！少来这套！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/4
msgid ""
"You say you're gonna give me a new life,\n"
"and then you nearly kill me?!\n"
msgstr ""
"你说要给我新生活，\n"
"结果差点要了我的命？！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/5
msgid ""
"I take it you didn't enjoy the trip?\n"
msgstr ""
"看来你这趟不太愉快？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/6
msgid ""
"What's the big idea, dragging me off in a...\n"
"balloon!\n"
msgstr ""
"你搞什么，用个……\n"
"气球把我拖走！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/7
msgid ""
"I might as well have taken a colibri!\n"
msgstr ""
"我还不如坐蜂鸟号！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/8
msgid ""
"At least you got a nice view. Or are you\n"
"afraid of heights?\n"
msgstr ""
"至少风景不错。还是说\n"
"你恐高？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/9
msgid ""
"Whatever. I just wish you'd explained it to\n"
"me first.\n"
msgstr ""
"随便吧。我只希望你先\n"
"跟我解释清楚。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/10
msgid ""
"Would you have agreed to go if I did?\n"
msgstr ""
"我解释了你就会答应吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/11
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving us, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你救我们，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/12
msgid ""
"Amanda, a word of advice.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达，给你个忠告。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/14
msgid ""
"Stop treating him like a child.\n"
msgstr ""
"别再把他当小孩了。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/15
msgid ""
"Yes... yes, I know. You're right. I shouldn't.\n"
msgstr ""
"是……是，我知道。你说得对，我不该这样。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/16
msgid ""
"Amanda, you're coming back after your\n"
"leg heals, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达，腿好了之后\n"
"你会回来吧？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/17
msgid ""
"Of course. We still have work to do.\n"
msgstr ""
"当然。我们还有事要做。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/18
msgid ""
"\"We,\" huh... Are you sure you've got\n"
"Chico's future in mind when you say that?\n"
msgstr ""
"“我们”……你说这话时，\n"
"有考虑过奇科的未来吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/19
msgid ""
"What do you mean? We're sworn to our\n"
"father's cause, to helping the revolution\n"
"succeed.\n"
msgstr ""
"什么意思？我们宣誓继承\n"
"父亲的遗志，帮助革命\n"
"成功。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/20
msgid ""
"Revolution or no revolution, you pick up a\n"
"gun, and sooner or later you're going to\n"
"hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"Revolution or no revolution, you pick up a\n"
"gun, and sooner or later you're going to\n"
"hell.\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/21
msgid ""
"Are you prepared for that?\n"
msgstr ""
"你准备好了吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/22
msgid ""
"I am. If the alternative is giving up the\n"
"country I love, I'll take hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"准备好了。若要我放弃深爱的祖国，\n"
"我宁愿下地狱。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/23
msgid ""
"Really... Well then, you're going to have to\n"
"stop treating Chico like a brother\n"
msgstr ""
"是吗……那你不能再把奇科\n"
"当弟弟看待，\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/24
msgid ""
"and start treating him like a soldier.\n"
msgstr ""
"而要把他当士兵。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/25
msgid ""
"I ...You're right.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……你说得对。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/26
msgid ""
"...Welcome to hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"……欢迎来到地狱。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/27
msgid ""
"Snake, can I ask you a favor?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，能拜托你吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/28
msgid ""
"Shoot.\n"
msgstr ""
"说吧。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/29
msgid ""
"You find any prisoners from el Frente,\n"
"you bring 'em back alive. 'Cause...\n"
msgstr ""
"找到Frente的俘虏，\n"
"要活捉带回来。因为……\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/30
msgid ""
"You trying to make amends for talking?\n"
msgstr ""
"你是想为泄密赎罪？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/31
msgid ""
"Not just that. Because they're compas...\n"
msgstr ""
"不止如此。因为他们是同胞……\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/32
msgid ""
"All right. But first I've gotta catch up to\n"
"that cargo.\n"
msgstr ""
"好。但我得先追上\n"
"那批货物。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/33
msgid ""
"I'll do whatever I can to help.\n"
msgstr ""
"我会尽力帮忙。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/34
msgid ""
"Call me if there's anything you need to\n"
"know about the area. And...\n"
msgstr ""
"想了解这一带的情况\n"
"就呼我。还有……\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/35
msgid ""
"And what?\n"
msgstr ""
"还有什么？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/36
msgid ""
"Let me know if you encounter any wildlife\n"
"you've never seen before.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是遇到没见过的野生动物，\n"
"告诉我。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/37
msgid ""
"Never seen before? What, like that\n"
"basilisco you were talking about?\n"
msgstr ""
"没见过的？像你说的\n"
"那种蛇怪？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/38
msgid ""
"I'm talking about UMAs.\n"
msgstr ""
"我说的是UMA。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/39
msgid ""
"U... M... As?\n"
msgstr ""
"未……知……生物？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/40
msgid ""
"Y'know, like ancient dinosaurs or\n"
"legendary monsters.\n"
msgstr ""
"就是古代恐龙或\n"
"传说怪物那种。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/41
msgid ""
"One day, I'm going to be a hunter.\n"
msgstr ""
"总有一天，我要当猎人。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/42
msgid ""
"Is that right. OK, sure.\n"
msgstr ""
"是吗。好，行。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/43
msgid ""
"If you wanna know more, I'm happy to tell\n"
"you!\n"
msgstr ""
"想了解更多，\n"
"我很乐意告诉你！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/44
msgid ""
"Right. I'll be in touch, Chico.\n"
msgstr ""
"好。保持联系，奇科。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/45
msgid ""
"OK, Snake. The enemy's cargo is headed\n"
"for the next outpost, a rail terminal.\n"
msgstr ""
"OK，SNAKE。敌人货物正运往\n"
"下一哨站，一个铁路终点站。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/46
msgid ""
"Chico says no one's ever set foot past\n"
"there.\n"
msgstr ""
"Chico说从没人踏足过\n"
"那里。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/47
msgid ""
"Their main base is probably on the other\n"
"side of that tunnel.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们的主基地很可能在隧道\n"
"另一侧。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/48
msgid ""
"Unless we catch those spears before\n"
"reaching it, they'll be in enemy hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"除非在抵达前截住那些长矛，\n"
"否则就会落入敌手。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/49
msgid ""
"You've got to stop them. Hurry, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"必须阻止他们。快，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, according to Chico, the nuclear\n"
"materials will be loaded from a train and\n"
"on to a truck\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，据Chico说，核材料会从一列火车上\n"
"卸下，再\n"
"装上卡车\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/1
msgid ""
"at a rail terminal near the eastern foot of\n"
"Irazú.\n"
msgstr ""
"在Irazú东麓附近的\n"
"一个铁路终端。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/2
msgid ""
"If we can't cut 'em off at that terminal,\n"
"we'll be in a world of hurt.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是在那个终端截不住，\n"
"我们就惨了。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/3
msgid ""
"Hurry, Snake!\n"
msgstr ""
"快，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389670/0
msgid ""
"Snake! That's an enemy tank unit.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE！敌方坦克部队。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389670/1
msgid ""
"Either neutralize the soldiers or destroy\n"
"the tank. Get 'em!\n"
msgstr ""
"要么解决士兵，要么摧毁\n"
"坦克。干掉他们！\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the truck is headed up the\n"
"mountain road past the tunnel.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，卡车正沿穿过隧道的\n"
"山路上行。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/1
msgid ""
"So it was nukes after all.\n"
msgstr ""
"果然是核弹。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/2
msgid ""
"What now? Their main base is up ahead.\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么办？主基地在前面。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/3
msgid ""
"I better hurry after 'em, then.\n"
msgstr ""
"那我得赶紧追上去。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/5
msgid ""
"Kaz, if I don't get moving it'll be too late!\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，再不动身就来不及了！\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/6
msgid ""
"All right.\n"
msgstr ""
"好吧。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/7
msgid ""
"I guess you never let dangerous\n"
"assignments or risk aversion get in your\n"
"way.\n"
msgstr ""
"我猜你从不让危险的\n"
"任务或对风险的顾虑挡你的\n"
"路。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/8
msgid ""
"How do I get inside the mountain? I can\n"
"forget about the tunnel.\n"
msgstr ""
"我该怎么进山？隧道\n"
"不用管了。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/9
msgid ""
"Yeah, the tank took care of that...\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，坦克解决了……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/10
msgid ""
"Any other routes?\n"
msgstr ""
"还有别的路吗？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/11
msgid ""
"Why don't I let a local expert take over?\n"
msgstr ""
"不如让本地专家来说？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/12
msgid ""
"Snake, you need a way into the mountain?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你要找进山的路？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/13
msgid ""
"Yeah. Got one?\n"
msgstr ""
"对。有吗？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/14
msgid ""
"Let's see... You remember that prison I\n"
"was in?\n"
msgstr ""
"我想想……记得我\n"
"待过的监狱吗？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/15
msgid ""
"In the village, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"在村里，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/16
msgid ""
"Right. Go back to the village and head\n"
"north.\n"
msgstr ""
"明白。回村子，然后往\n"
"北走。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/17
msgid ""
"There's a bridge that connects to the\n"
"mountain road.\n"
msgstr ""
"有一座桥连接着\n"
"山路。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/18
msgid ""
"It crosses over a gorge. That's probably\n"
"the best way...\n"
msgstr ""
"它横跨峡谷。那大概\n"
"是最好的路线……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/19
msgid ""
"But there is a little problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"但有个小问题。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/20
msgid ""
"The path heading north from the village\n"
"is barricaded.\n"
msgstr ""
"从村子往北的那条路\n"
"被路障封住了。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/21
msgid ""
"You might have to break through...\n"
msgstr ""
"你可能得强行突破……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/23
msgid ""
"The heart of Irazú...\n"
msgstr ""
"伊拉苏心脏……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/24
msgid ""
"That's where the enemy's base has got\n"
"to be, Snake. And maybe...\n"
msgstr ""
"That's where the enemy's base has got\n"
"to be, Snake. And maybe...\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/25
msgid ""
"Let me guess - the basilisco?\n"
msgstr ""
"让我猜猜——蛇怪？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/26
msgid ""
"You don't believe me, do you?\n"
msgstr ""
"你不信我，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/27
msgid ""
"No, I mean... We'll have to see.\n"
msgstr ""
"不，我是说……得亲眼看看。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/28
msgid ""
"Snake, Irazú features a number of crater\n"
"lakes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，伊拉苏有好几个火山口\n"
"湖。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/29
msgid ""
"The Oduber government had planned to\n"
"use those lakes\n"
msgstr ""
"奥杜贝尔政府曾计划\n"
"利用那些湖\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/30
msgid ""
"to construct hydroelectric plants as one\n"
"of its big state development projects.\n"
msgstr ""
"修建水电站，作为其\n"
"大型国家开发项目之一。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/31
msgid ""
"The project was scrapped,\n"
msgstr ""
"项目被取消了，\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/32
msgid ""
"but there's still a small opening at the\n"
"bottom of the lake.\n"
msgstr ""
"但湖底仍然有一个\n"
"小开口。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/34
msgid ""
"I checked the satellite imagery, but didn't\n"
"see anything man-made.\n"
msgstr ""
"我查看了卫星图像，但没\n"
"看到任何人造物。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/35
msgid ""
"Which means they've probably built a\n"
"base inside the mountain...\n"
msgstr ""
"这意味着他们很可能在山体\n"
"内建了基地……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/36
msgid ""
"Could just be a storage igloo for\n"
"explosives, or maybe some kind of\n"
"research facility.\n"
msgstr ""
"可能只是个存放\n"
"炸药的圆顶仓库，或者某种\n"
"研究设施。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/37
msgid ""
"What do they hope to accomplish by\n"
"bringing the nukes there?\n"
msgstr ""
"他们把核弹运到那，\n"
"到底想干什么？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/38
msgid ""
"First things first. Get past that barricade\n"
"north of the village.\n"
msgstr ""
"先做最要紧的事。越过村子\n"
"北边那个路障。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/39
msgid ""
"Looks like the only way through is the\n"
"noisy way - you'll have to blow it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来唯一的办法就是\n"
"闹出动静——你得把它炸掉。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a380/0
msgid ""
"Snake, you're north of the village.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你在村子北边。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a380/1
msgid ""
"The truck carrying the nukes is heading\n"
"towards the heart of the mountain.\n"
msgstr ""
"载着核弹的卡车正朝\n"
"山体中心驶去。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a380/2
msgid ""
"That's its final destination. We've got no\n"
"intel on what lies beyond, so stay sharp.\n"
msgstr ""
"那就是终点。我们对\n"
"前方一无所知，保持警惕。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a500/0
msgid ""
"Careful, Snake!!\n"
msgstr ""
"小心，SNAKE！！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a500/1
msgid ""
"I've never seen anything like that, and I've\n"
"got no idea how to bring it down.\n"
msgstr ""
"我从没见过这种东西，\n"
"也不知道怎么把它打下来。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a500/2
msgid ""
"Maybe the scientist knows. However you\n"
"do it, take that thing out!\n"
msgstr ""
"也许那科学家知道。不管怎样，\n"
"把那东西干掉！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the doctor's safe here with us.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，博士在这很安全。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/1
msgid ""
"Huey, how're you feeling?\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊，感觉如何？\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/2
msgid ""
"Never better. This is quite the pad you've\n"
"got here, Boss. I'm impressed.\n"
msgstr ""
"再好不过了。你这基地真不错，BOSS。\n"
"我很佩服。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/3
msgid ""
"Call me Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"叫我SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/4
msgid ""
"Whatever you say. Like it or not,\n"
"everyone here calls you Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"随你便。不管喜不喜欢，\n"
"这儿的人都叫你BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/5
msgid ""
"By the way, if you're at all interested in\n"
"improving your tech,\n"
msgstr ""
"对了，如果你有兴趣\n"
"提升技术的话，\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/6
msgid ""
"by all means assign me to the R&D section.\n"
msgstr ""
"尽管把我派到研发部门。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/7
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure I'll be of some use.\n"
msgstr ""
"我肯定能派上用场。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/8
msgid ""
"Once we have the necessary materials\n"
"and blueprints, we can start work on that\n"
"bipedal mech.\n"
msgstr ""
"一旦有了必要的材料和图纸，\n"
"我们就能开始造那台\n"
"双足机甲了。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/9
msgid ""
"I appreciate that, but are you sure you're\n"
"OK with having your work used for war?\n"
msgstr ""
"多谢，但你确定\n"
"愿意让自己的成果用于战争？\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/10
msgid ""
"I'm... I'll be using it to keep past mistakes\n"
"in check.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……我会用它来\n"
"约束过去的错误。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/11
msgid ""
"If I can help thwart the Peace Walker\n"
"project, I'm happy to do it.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果能帮忙挫败和平行者\n"
"计划，我很乐意。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/12
msgid ""
"Deterrence theory, Huey-style, huh?\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊式威慑理论，是吧？\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/13
msgid ""
"Heh. Anyway, if you need any intel on the\n"
"enemy's weapons or electronic brains,\n"
"contact me.\n"
msgstr ""
"呵。总之，如果你需要敌方武器\n"
"或电子脑的情报，\n"
"就联系我。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/14
msgid ""
"I've been given my own frequency.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们给了我专属频率。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/15
msgid ""
"Sounds good to me, Doc. I'll do that.\n"
msgstr ""
"不错，博士。我会的。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/16
msgid ""
"Good. Whatever the means, you must put\n"
"a stop to their plans!\n"
msgstr ""
"很好。不管怎样，\n"
"必须阻止他们！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker is the heart of the\n"
"enemy's project.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，和平行者是\n"
"敌方计划的核心。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/1
msgid ""
"To prevent its completion,\n"
msgstr ""
"要阻止它完成，\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/2
msgid ""
"you'll need to either shut down or destroy\n"
"the artificial intelligence that functions as\n"
"its brain.\n"
msgstr ""
"你得关闭或摧毁\n"
"充当其大脑的\n"
"人工智能。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/3
msgid ""
"According to Huey,\n"
msgstr ""
"据休伊说，\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/4
msgid ""
"that AI is now undergoing final\n"
"calibrations in Strangelove's lab.\n"
msgstr ""
"那个AI正在斯特兰奇洛夫的\n"
"实验室里做最终校准。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/5
msgid ""
"It's inside a tropical cloud forest.\n"
msgstr ""
"在热带云雾林里。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/6
msgid ""
"Slip in and terminate that AI before they\n"
"ship it out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Slip in and terminate that AI before they\n"
"ship it out.\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38af00/0
msgid ""
"Snake! That's a Hind! You've got to take\n"
"it out somehow!\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake！那是雌鹿！快想办法\n"
"干掉它！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38af00/1
msgid ""
"Either neutralize the soldiers or bring\n"
"down the chopper! Good luck!\n"
msgstr ""
"要么解决士兵，要么打下直升机！\n"
"祝你好运！\n"
